  "findings": [
    "Visible queries are dominated by Kuinbee brand variants. This export cannot establish the intent of omitted/anonymized queries.",
    "The dataset catalogue has 67 impressions and zero clicks; custom commercial destinations have very little visible search traffic.",
    "The homepage receives 41 of the 49 clicks reported in the Pages table; page-level counts are not the property total.",
    "Mobile accounts for 28 of 48 property clicks; India accounts for 33.",
    "Search appearance export contains a header only, not evidence that rich results are invalid.",
    "Pages.csv totals 49 clicks and 872 impressions. Do not add these to Chart.csv property totals because Search Console uses different aggregation.",
    "The previous sitemap fetched the wrong dataset response property and omitted all 368 published dataset URLs.",
    "The old datasets and custom-service index HTML contained Suspense/loading shells rather than the catalogue content.",
    "Dataset metadata was generic; custom-service detail metadata inherited a homepage canonical.",
    "The live pricing URL already returned 404 but was advertised in the sitemap and two internal links.",
    "Canonical alternatives and redirected pages are normally intentionally excluded from the index. Not every Search Console exclusion is a defect."
  ],
  "implementation": [
    "Paginated read-only public API consumption with caching and honest source update dates; canonical www sitemap, deduplicated and without /pricing or /analytics.",
    "Server-rendered dataset and custom-service listings/details, hydrated into the existing client query cache.",
    "Real titles, descriptions, canonical links, Dataset and breadcrumb JSON-LD from existing published records.",
    "Actual HTTP 404 and noindex for absent dataset/service/category records by removing streaming route loading boundaries; reusable skeleton components retained.",
    "14 nonempty dataset-category pages with crawlable dataset links, genuine published listing counts, self-canonical pagination, and internal links from the homepage and catalogue.",
    "Frontend permanent redirect /analytics to /strotas.",
    "Pricing links replaced with appropriate contact links; no pricing page created.",
    "Static search placeholder, static/scrollable mobile supplier strip, responsive logo sizing, and no duplicate category image when light/dark images are identical.",
    "Corrected invalid ARIA roles/attributes, muted-text contrast, and skipped heading levels.",
    "Local static Product Hunt badge without a stale vote counter or third-party cookies.",
    "Authentication form JavaScript deferred until a user opens an account modal; authentication behavior and backend requests unchanged.",
    "Removed whole-page opacity-zero entrance animation so the initial heading is immediately visible and eligible as an LCP candidate.",
    "Optional font display keeps fallback text stable on slow first visits while retaining Inter on fast/cached visits.",
    "Dataset pages generate on demand, not during build, because the existing detail API records views; regression detail reads require an explicit --allow-view-tracking option."
  ],
