    "The supplied exports do not list the four exact historical 404 URLs or the eleven crawled-but-not-indexed URLs; individual old-URL remediation requires those lists.",
    "Local browser auth/me requests hit localhost CORS restrictions. No backend CORS or authentication changes were made.",
    "Local Lighthouse lab measurements are not production Core Web Vitals or guaranteed ranking gains.",
    "Existing unrelated industry-page, customer-logo, team and navigation edits were preserved in the user checkout, and excluded from the isolated validation worktree.",
    "After an approved frontend deployment, verify the live sitemap/pages, resubmit the sitemap, and request inspection for priority category/listing URLs. Indexing and higher rankings are not guaranteed.",
